<title>INDIA: India IDBI 96/97 net up at 11.41 bln. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>India IDBI 96/97 net up at 11.41 bln. [CORRECTED 10:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian termlender the Industrial and Development Bank of India (IDBI) said its 1996/97 (April-March) net profit had risen to 11.44 (corrects figure from 11.41) billion rupees from 10.07 billion rupees the previous year.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom =91-22-265 9000</p>
